    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.2",
      "title": null,
      "body": "Round Victories vs. Losses or Hits Earned vs. Hits Received:\nFor Buhurt and Buckler, the focus is on the overall performance in rounds, emphasizing consistent success in matches.\nFor Other Duels, the ratio of hits emphasizes skill in both offense and defense, giving a balanced view of performance.\nAction: Use the appropriate difference or ratio based on the type of event:\nBuhurt and Buckler: Compare the difference between round victories and losses. This is found in Column G (Win-Ratio).\nOther Duels: Compare the ratio of hits earned to hits received. This is found in Column S (Hits Earned / Hits Received) on the scoresheet.\n\nStep three (3) if the tie was not resolved with 2.2",
