      "body": "Active vs Downed Competitors:\nThis metric provides insight into team durability and effectiveness in maintaining active competitors throughout the tournament, highlighting strategic strength.\nAction: Evaluate the difference between active competitors at the end of each round and downed competitors at the end of each round during the tournament.\nThis is reflected in the S-G Difference (Active vs. Grounded difference) on the event result sheet.\n\nStep four (4) if the tie was not resolved with 2.3",
