      "ordinal": 27,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.1",
      "title": null,
      "body": "Cumulative scoring based on tournament progression and pool size:\n● 1 point for each pool victory (or round-robin victory).\n● 2 points for each elimination victory.\n● 2 points for 3rd.\n● 4 points for 2nd.\n● 6 points for 1st.\nImportant:\nRound Robin format FINALS are not scored beyond placement",
