      "kind": "note",
      "number": "7",
      "title": "Change log",
      "body": "This will be the change log of this document. It will be updated regularly and we will display what has been removed/added/reworded/formatted. This way we keep transparent communication and clarity about the rules\n\nUpdate date: January 2026 Add: 2. Cards Yellow/Red Cards: only affect the tournament they take place in, they do not carry over into other tournaments at the event.\nGreen Cards: Follow the competitor from tournament to tournament, but the same green card violation will not stack with itself per each tournament.\nChange: 4.2 Multiplier of the Event Add: 4.4 Add: 5 Add: 6\n\nUpdate date: March-2025 (V2025.03)\n- format: Grammar and formatting Update date: June-2024\n- format: Grammar and formatting Update date: March-2024\n- format: new design format, document will be used from now on.\nUpdate date: april-2024\n- Removal: Option 2B: The remaining four teams will participate in a single elimination bracket. An additional match will establish the 3rd and 4th place.\n\n- Rewording: Fights > Matches\n\n- Added 1.8.2 A difference/ratio :\n● For all other Duels: Hits-H-Diff on the scoresheet\n- Added 1.9.2 Multiplier for Tier of Event\n● 0.5 points for Source",
